Z||000000||MotherGoose||05-11-2000||07:41 PM||||I actually didn't have an ECM problem, The power going to it was disconnected.  I decided that I would take one more look around to see if I could find something, and I did, the power connector that gives the ECM power was a part. So bingo bango...ROOOOOM.  Of course as soon as I got it on the road the Uni-Belt broke, but at least I know what it is this time.<P>I want to thank everyone that tried to help, this is a great site and I hope its here for ever.  If you ever need help Cliff just give me a yell.<P>One more question...It seems that exaust is only coming out of one side of my pipes, whats up?<P>Thank you again<P>Mother||||reg||10
Z||000001||Old Lar||05-11-2000||08:21 PM||||Exhaust.  The exhaust always seemed to come out the passenger side of the quad pipes for as long as I have owned the car (13 years).  As a matter of fact, it seems to come out the outside of the chrome tips.  I'm polishing that one more.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif">||||reg||3
